ARM PrimeCell Generic Install Script
------------------------------------

This directory contains the INSTALL script required to build the
correct directory structure for an ARM PrimeCell from a distribution.

The script should be run in-place, i.e. from this directory.

USAGE : INSTALL <PLnum> <release> [<PLnum> <release>] <destination>

This script will unpack the specified ARM PrimeCell deliverables
into the directory <destination>.

<PLnum> should be the ARM Code for the PrimeCell to be unpacked,
for example "PL170"

<release> should be the release version to be unpacked, e.g. "REL2v1"

<destination> should be the directory into which you want the
distribution unpacked.  If the destination directory already
exists, any files overwritten by this new distribution will be
renamed to include a ".bak" extension.

For example,

    ./INSTALL PL170 REL2v1 /arm/primecells

Please report any problems with this script to support-primecell@arm.com
